LICENSE STUB (needs Legal review before any helper binary ships)

This directory contains no Steamworks SDK code. A future steam-ticket-helper
binary built from it links the Valve Steamworks SDK, which is distributed
under the Steamworks SDK Access Agreement, not under the GPL. The helper is a
separate program that the GPL-3.0 PuggieType desktop app starts as its own
process and talks to only through its standard output.

The licence for the helper's own source, and the terms for redistributing
the Steamworks redistributable files with it, are to be decided by Legal.
Until then, do not ship a built helper.
